  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fass Boye Carrot Production and Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the production, storage, conservation and marketing capacities of market gardeners in the Fass Boye area and surrounding areas. .The financing of this project will allow the GIE to better plan and organize the sales of the members&apos; carrot productions, to avoid parallel marketing channels as it is the case at the moment and to increase the income of the members and the GIE. .The GIE sows an average of 4.6 hectares of carrots, 3 hectares of potatoes and 1.7 hectares of green onions. It produces an average of 500 tons of carrots, 278 tons of potatoes and 258 tons of green onions.</narrative>
  </description>
